========================================================================
Suggested rewrite:

[TYPE, one letter] [Number, separate per type]_[Name][* if crucial] {Other values}
  - in between quality is ~
  - accuracy should be range [n..m]? or makes sense in general
  - {} does not make ID, as there won't be another Baedoor
  - material (Nb) could be made into type, as there's rarely the same type
    having paper and notebook version, and separating those will be handy
Example (acc: 2 for range [0..5]):

L 001_Baedoor* {~2}

More precise:

L 001_Baedoor* {qual: ~, acc: 2}

